{"jobs": [{"absolute_url": "https://www.coinbase.com/careers/positions/8053751?gh_jid=8053751", "data_compliance": [{"type": "gdpr", "requires_consent": false, "requires_processing_consent": false, "requires_retention_consent": false, "retention_period": null, "demographic_data_consent_applies": false}], "education": "education_required", "employment": "employment_required", "internal_job_id": 3344554, "location": {"name": "Remote - Cyprus"}, "metadata": [{"id": 166433, "name": "Team", "value": "Finance", "value_type": "single_select"}, {"id": 11090754, "name": "HM Employee ID (WD)", "value": "208503", "value_type": "short_text"}, {"id": 3174030, "name": "Careersite Department (for job postings)", "value": "Finance & Accounting", "value_type": "single_select"}, {"id": 13234829, "name": "mule_sourcers_counter_custom", "value": null, "value_type": "number"}, {"id": 13234830, "name": "mule_recruiters_counter_custom", "value": null, "value_type": "number"}], "id": 8053751, "updated_at": "2026-08-28T10:51:50-04:00", "requisition_id": "P75632", "title": "Accountant, Cyprus", "company_name": "Coinbase", "first_published": "2026-07-09T12:25:25-04:00", "language": "en", "application_deadline": null, "content": "&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Accountant on the Cyprus Finance team, you&#39;ll be responsible for the day-to-day accounting operations of Coinbase Financial Services Europe Ltd (CBFSE), our MiFID-regulated entity. You&#39;ll own critical accounting workflows including journal entries, reconciliations, and regulatory reporting to CySEC and the Central Bank of Cyprus, ensuring Coinbase&#39;s financial records accurately reflect our evolving crypto business across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own daily operational accounting for CBFSE, including recording journal entries, preparing supporting schedules, and maintaining balance sheet reconciliations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute daily reconciliation reporting and other periodic regulatory submissions required by CySEC, the Central Bank of Cyprus, and applicable CIF frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with FP&amp;amp;A, Tax, Treasury, Source-to-Pay, and engineering teams to ensure proper accounting treatment and accurate financial reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal and external audit processes by providing documentation, analysis, and timely responses within your areas of responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data analysis against business drivers to identify trends, resolve discrepancies, and recommend process improvements to strengthen accounting operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in accounting or finance within a Cyprus Investment Firm (CIF), Big Four firm, or financial services/fintech company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting or related field, with professional qualifications (ACCA, ACA, or CPA) preferred; CySEC certifications (Advanced and/or AML Certificate) a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated working knowledge of IFRS, with hands-on experience applying IFRS standards to operational accounting and financial reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in NetSuite, FloQast, and G-Suite, with advanced Excel skills applied to reconciliations and financial analysis is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CySEC and CIF regulatory reporting requirements, including the ability to interpret and apply regulatory guidance to accounting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Position ID: P75632&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
